---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { businessContact, servicesById, workflows } from '../data/business';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="工作流 · siuser小伟"
  description="AI 外呼与回访、内容生产与分发、业务流程与看板的工作流设计方式，以及每条流程中的人工兜底。"
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1 workflows-page">
    <section class="workflows-hero page-shell" aria-labelledby="workflows-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="section-kicker">Workflow notes / human in the loop</p>
        <h1 id="workflows-title">工作流不是<br />“自动跑起来”。</h1>
        <p>
          更重要的是：什么时候该停下来、谁来判断、怎么把异常交给人。这三条工作流展示的是当前可讨论的组织方式，而不是不经判断就复制的模板。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-margin" aria-label="工作流原则">
        <p>THE WORKBENCH TEST</p>
        <div class="margin-rule"></div>
        <blockquote>
          <span>“</span>
          <p>如果流程无法说明输入、责任人和例外，它还不适合自动化。</p>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="workflow-section page-shell" aria-label="三条业务工作流">
      <header class="workflow-intro">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">Three working loops</p>
          <h2>把 AI 放在<br /><em>可被校对</em>的位置。</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          每一条流程都从已有资料和明确的业务责任开始。工具可以协助整理、触发、生成和记录；判断、承诺和高风险动作依然必须保留在人的手里。
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="workflow-list">
        {workflows.map((workflow) => (
          <article class="workflow-entry" aria-labelledby={`${workflow.id}-title`}>
            <header class="workflow-heading">
              <div class="workflow-number" aria-hidden="true">{workflow.number}</div>
              <div>
                <p>{workflow.eyebrow}</p>
                <h2 id={`${workflow.id}-title`}>{workflow.title}</h2>
              </div>
              <div class="related-services">
                <span>相关支撑</span>
                <div>
                  {workflow.relatedServices.map((serviceId) => {
                    const service = servicesById[serviceId];
                    return <a href={`/services#${service.id}`}>{service.shortTitle}</a>;
                  })}
                </div>
              </div>
            </header>

            <div class="workflow-overview">
              <p>{workflow.summary}</p>
              <aside>
                <span>开始前提</span>
                <p>{workflow.entryCondition}</p>
              </aside>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-board">
              <section class="input-column">
                <h3>输入材料</h3>
                <ul>
                  {workflow.inputs.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
                </ul>
              </section>

              <ol class="stage-list">
                {workflow.stages.map((stage, index) => (
                  <li>
                    <span class="stage-count">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
                    <div>
                      <h3>{stage.title}</h3>
                      <p>{stage.description}</p>
                      <span class="stage-output"><b>留下：</b>{stage.output}</span>
                    </div>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ol>
            </div>

            <div class="handoff-row">
              <div>
                <span>人工兜底 / handoff</span>
                <p>{workflow.humanFallback}</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span>这条流程留下什么</span>
                <ul>
                  {workflow.deliverables.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="fit-notes">
              <section>
                <h3>适合</h3>
                <ul>{workflow.fit.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
              </section>
              <section>
                <h3>不适合</h3>
                <ul>{workflow.notFit.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
              </section>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="closing-section page-shell" aria-labelledby="workflow-closing-title">
      <div class="closing-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      <div class="closing-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">A useful first conversation</p>
          <h2 id="workflow-closing-title">先确认流程有没有<br />值得被做出来。</h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="closing-copy">
            如果你有一条正在反复卡住的业务链路，可以先描述它现在是怎么走的、在哪一步丢信息或等人。我们先判断它是否适合进入工作流，而不是先承诺做一个大系统。
          </p>
          <a class="closing-action" href={`mailto:${businessContact.email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('咨询：业务工作流')}`}>
            发起工作流讨论 <span>↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .workflows-page { padding-bottom: 1px; }

  .page-shell {
    width: min(100% - 3rem, var(--container-max));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .workflows-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(17rem, 0.55fr);
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 10vw, 11rem);
    align-items: end;
    min-height: min(39rem, calc(100vh - 4.5rem));
    padding-top: clamp(7rem, 12vw, 11rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .hero-copy { max-width: 44rem; }

  .hero-copy h1 {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    max-width: 10ch;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6.3vw, 5.5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1.03;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .hero-copy > p:last-child {
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.35vw, 1.14rem);
    line-height: 1.9;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .hero-margin {
    padding: 0 0 0.25rem 1.35rem;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
  }

  .hero-margin > p,
  .hero-margin blockquote span {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .margin-rule {
    width: 4.5rem;
    height: 2px;
    margin: 1.2rem 0;
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .hero-margin blockquote {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.25rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .hero-margin blockquote span {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    line-height: 0.8;
  }

  .hero-margin blockquote p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .workflow-section { padding-bottom: clamp(5rem, 11vw, 9.5rem); }

  .workflow-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(16rem, 0.57fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 10vw, 10rem);
    align-items: end;
    padding: 1.5rem 0 3.7rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
  }

  .workflow-intro h2,
  .closing-grid h2 {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.7vw, 3.3rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .workflow-intro h2 em { color: var(--color-accent); }

  .workflow-intro > p {
    max-width: 30rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    line-height: 1.82;
  }

  .workflow-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }

  .workflow-entry {
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6.5rem) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .workflow-heading {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(5.2rem, 7rem) minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(11rem, 0.33fr);
    gap: 1.3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .workflow-number {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 5vw, 4.8rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 0.85;
  }

  .workflow-heading > div:nth-child(2) > p {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .workflow-heading h2 {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 3.3rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.12;
  }

  .related-services {
    justify-self: end;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    width: 100%;
    padding-top: 0.3rem;
  }

  .related-services > span,
  .handoff-row > div > span {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .related-services > div {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }

  .related-services a {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.52rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.63rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .related-services a:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .workflow-overview {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(14rem, 0.42fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    margin: 1.8rem 0 0 calc(clamp(5.2rem, 7vw, 7rem) + 1.3rem);
  }

  .workflow-overview > p {
    max-width: 46rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.45vw, 1.12rem);
    line-height: 1.9;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .workflow-overview aside {
    padding: 0.9rem 0 0.15rem 1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
  }

  .workflow-overview aside span {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.63rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .workflow-overview aside p {
    margin-top: 0.48rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .workflow-board {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, 0.35fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    margin-top: 2.7rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .input-column {
    padding: 1.4rem 1.35rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 50%, var(--bg));
  }

  .input-column h3 {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .input-column ul,
  .handoff-row ul,
  .fit-notes ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.62rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .input-column li,
  .handoff-row li,
  .fit-notes li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  .input-column li::before,
  .handoff-row li::before,
  .fit-notes li::before {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    content: '·';
    font-size: 1.15em;
  }

  .stage-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .stage-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.7rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .stage-list li:first-child { border-top: 0; }

  .stage-count {
    padding-top: 0.15rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.67rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .stage-list h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.16rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .stage-list p {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.66;
  }

  .stage-output {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .stage-output b {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .handoff-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(13rem, 0.72fr);
    gap: 1px;
    margin-top: 1px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--border);
  }

  .handoff-row > div { padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem 1.35rem; background: var(--bg); }
  .handoff-row > div:first-child { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface-strong) 46%, var(--bg)); }
  .handoff-row > div:first-child > span { color: var(--color-accent); }

  .handoff-row p {
    margin-top: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.91rem;
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  .handoff-row ul { margin-top: 0.72rem; }

  .fit-notes {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin: 1.8rem 0 0 calc(clamp(5.2rem, 7vw, 7rem) + 1.3rem);
  }

  .fit-notes section { padding-top: 0.85rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .fit-notes h3 {
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .fit-notes section:first-child { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 45%, var(--border)); }
  .fit-notes section:first-child h3 { color: var(--color-accent); }

  .closing-section { padding-bottom: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem); }

  .closing-bar {
    display: flex;
    height: 2px;
  }

  .closing-bar span:nth-child(1) { width: 58%; background: var(--color-accent); }
  .closing-bar span:nth-child(2) { width: 25%; background: var(--border-strong); }
  .closing-bar span:nth-child(3) { flex: 1; background: var(--border); }

  .closing-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(17rem, 0.68fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 10vw, 10rem);
    padding-top: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.4rem);
  }

  .closing-copy {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .closing-action {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0 0.7rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .closing-action span { color: var(--color-accent); font-size: 1rem; transition: transform 0.15s ease; }
  .closing-action:hover { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .closing-action:hover span { transform: translate(2px, -2px); }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .workflows-hero, .workflow-intro, .closing-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .workflows-hero { min-height: 0; }
    .workflow-intro { gap: 1.25rem; }
    .workflow-heading { grid-template-columns: 5.2rem minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .related-services { grid-column: 2; justify-self: start; }
    .related-services > div { justify-content: flex-start; }
    .workflow-overview { margin-left: 0; }
    .fit-notes { margin-left: 0; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .page-shell { width: min(100% - 2rem, var(--container-max)); }
    .workflows-hero { padding-top: 6.5rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; }
    .hero-copy h1 { font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 13vw, 4rem); }
    .hero-margin { max-width: 27rem; }
    .workflow-heading { grid-template-columns: 3.5rem minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 0.8rem; }
    .workflow-number { font-size: 3rem; }
    .related-services { grid-column: 2; }
    .workflow-overview, .workflow-board, .handoff-row, .fit-notes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .workflow-board { margin-top: 2rem; }
    .input-column { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .stage-list li { padding: 1.15rem 1rem; }
    .closing-grid h2 br { display: none; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .closing-action span { transition: none; }
  }
</style>
